# User-facing documentation set. These were missing from the allowlist above,
# so `docs/*` hid them: README.md linked to docs/README.md, GETTING_STARTED,
# ARCHITECTURE, FAQ and I18N, and every one of those links 404'd on a fresh
# clone. Internal working notes under docs/ stay ignored on purpose — only the
# docs we publish belong here.
